    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "Obligation";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Quorum requirement when a member cannot participate due to rules made under section 29 of the Public Governance, Performance and Accountability Act 2013.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(2) However, if: (a) rules made for the purposes of section 29 of the Public Governance, Performance and Accountability Act 2013 prevent a member from participating in the deliberations, or decisions, of the ACMA with respect to a particular matter; and (b) when the member leaves the meeting concerned there is no longer a quorum present;";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "the remaining members at the meeting constitute a quorum for the purpose of any deliberation or decision at that meeting with respect to that matter.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/executionSurface> "modalities::logic::deontic";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/confidence> 1.0000;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/curationStatus> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/Proposed>.
